  "description": "Grok 4.6 is xAI's frontier reasoning model for coding, agentic tasks and knowledge work, released in August 2026 as the successor to Grok 4.5. xAI focused it on long-running agents and ambitious interactive and visual projects, such as turning a broad product idea into a working first version and refining it over several rounds. It accepts text and image input with text output and configurable reasoning effort; Grok 4.7 succeeded it in September 2026.",
